    "Is this a sales call?": "这是一次销售电话吗？",
    "No. It is a structured diagnostic conversation to identify likely bottlenecks and the safest next step.": "不是。这是一次结构化的诊断沟通，用于识别可能的瓶颈以及最稳妥的下一步。",
    "How much does the diagnostic cost?": "诊断的费用是多少？",
    "The initial diagnostic conversation (30-45 minutes) is complimentary and carries no obligation. If the diagnostic identifies a clear next step, we provide a fixed-scope proposal with defined deliverables and pricing before any commitment. Paid engagements are scoped individually based on the number of systems, workflows, and stakeholders involved.": "首次诊断沟通（30-45 分钟）是免费的，且无任何义务。如果诊断发现明确的下一步，我们会在您做出任何承诺之前，提供包含明确交付物和报价的固定范围方案。付费合作会根据所涉及的系统、工作流和相关方数量单独界定范围。",
    "How long does the diagnostic process take?": "诊断流程需要多长时间？",
    "The first conversation takes 30-45 minutes. A paid audit, assessment, or roadmap usually depends on the number of systems, workflows, and stakeholders involved.": "首次沟通耗时 30-45 分钟。付费的审计、评估或路线图所需时间通常取决于所涉及的系统、工作流和相关方数量。",
    "Do you implement systems?": "你们负责系统落地实施吗？",
    "Yes, when the diagnostic, audit, assessment, roadmap, or architecture review validates the scope.": "是的，当诊断、审计、评估、路线图或架构评审验证了相应范围时，我们会负责落地实施。",
    "Do you work remotely or on-site?": "你们是远程工作还是驻场工作？",
    "Most diagnostic and advisory work is remote-first. On-site work in California is available when the scope requires it.": "大部分诊断和顾问工作以远程为主。当范围需要时，可在加州提供驻场服务。",
    "What systems do you work with?": "你们支持哪些系统？",
    "We work with environments using HubSpot, Salesforce, Pipedrive, Asana, Monday, Notion, QuickBooks, Zapier, Make, and related business tools.": "我们支持使用 HubSpot、Salesforce、Pipedrive、Asana、Monday、Notion、QuickBooks、Zapier、Make 及相关业务工具的系统环境。",
    "Who do you work with best?": "你们最适合与谁合作？",
    "Our strongest fit is a B2B company with 50-250 employees that is facing:": "与我们契合度最高的是拥有 50-250 名员工、正面临以下情况的 B2B 企业：",
    "Cross-functional process or system complexity": "跨职能的流程或系统复杂性",
