    "A predetermined tool-first project that excludes problem definition": "已预设工具优先、排除问题界定环节的项目",
    "Requests for guaranteed ROI before baseline analysis": "在基线分析之前就要求保证 ROI 的需求",
    "A no-fit decision is a valid outcome, and we will recommend a safer next step where possible.": "判定不适合也是一个有效的结论，我们会尽可能建议更稳妥的下一步。",
    "Do you guarantee ROI?": "你们保证 ROI 吗？",
    "No. ROI requires baseline data, scope definition, adoption risk review, and implementation assumptions.": "不保证。ROI 取决于基线数据、范围界定、采纳风险评审以及落地假设。",
    "Do you handle O-1 visa petitions?": "你们代办 O-1 签证申请吗？",
    "We do not provide legal advice or file immigration petitions. What we offer is O-1 readiness support: helping IT professionals and founders build the evidence portfolio that demonstrates extraordinary ability: publications, speaking, expert positioning, and recommendation strategy. Petition filing and legal counsel are provided by qualified immigration attorneys we coordinate with.": "我们不提供法律意见，也不代为提交移民申请。我们提供的是 O-1 就绪支持：帮助 IT 专业人士和创始人构建能证明杰出能力的证据集--发表成果、演讲、专家定位以及推荐策略。申请提交和法律意见由我们协同合作、具备资质的移民律师提供。",
