    "Illustrative diagnostic summary: a B2B services firm where leads dropped between marketing and sales; the diagnostic found four undocumented handoff points and delivered a single owner per lead stage, with an estimated $180K+ in revenue at risk addressed on a 30-day cleanup.": "示意性诊断摘要：一家 B2B 服务公司的线索在市场与销售之间流失；诊断发现了四个缺乏文档的交接点，并为每个线索阶段指定了唯一负责人，通过30天整改处置了估计 $180K+ 的潜在流失收入。",
