    "Inbound leads were falling between marketing and sales: no defined handoff owner, no SLA, and 3 duplicate CRM fields creating confusion.": "入站线索在市场与销售之间流失--没有明确的交接负责人，没有 SLA，还有 3 个重复的 CRM 字段造成混乱。",
    "4 undocumented handoff points across 2 teams with no shared visibility.": "跨 2 个团队的 4 个缺乏文档的交接点，且缺乏共享的可见性。",
    "Handoff process reduced from 5 steps to 2. Single ownership assigned per lead stage. Estimated revenue at risk from dropped handoffs:": "交接流程从 5 步精简为 2 步。每个线索阶段指定唯一负责人。因交接流失而估计的潜在流失收入：",
    "annually. 30-day cleanup priority list adopted by both teams.": "每年。两个团队均采纳了30天整改优先级清单。",
    "Leadership did not trust dashboard numbers because 3 departments used different definitions for the same metrics.": "管理层不信任仪表盘上的数据--3 个部门对相同指标使用了不同的定义。",
    "7 inconsistent metric definitions and 2 disconnected data sources feeding the same dashboard.": "为同一仪表盘供数的 7 个口径不一致的指标定义和 2 个彼此割裂的数据源。",
    "Unified reporting definitions document covering 7 previously inconsistent metrics. Data-source consolidation plan projected to remove": "统一的报表口径定义文档，涵盖此前 7 个口径不一致的指标。数据源整合方案预计可消除",
    "of manual reconciliation. BI roadmap prioritized by stakeholder impact with 90-day execution timeline.": "的人工对账工作。BI 路线图按相关方影响排定优先级，并配以90天执行时间表。",
    "4 locations running different approval workflows with 6 overlapping tools and no shared process documentation.": "4 个网点各自运行不同的审批工作流，使用 6 个功能重叠的工具，且没有共享的流程文档。",
    "11 manual approval steps that could be reduced to 4 with workflow consolidation.": "11 个人工审批步骤，通过工作流整合可精简至 4 个。",
    "Bottleneck map identified an estimated": "瓶颈图谱识别出估计",
    "in annual labor cost tied to manual approvals. Automation backlog ranked by effort and impact. 90-day roadmap adopted by operations leadership with projected 60% reduction in approval cycle time.": "的年度人力成本与人工审批相关。自动化待办事项按投入和影响排序。运营管理层采纳了90天路线图，预计可将审批周期缩短 60%。",
    "Scenarios reflect patterns from real diagnostic engagements with B2B companies of 50-250 employees. Figures represent the range of impact typically identified.": "场景反映了与50-250人B2B公司的真实诊断项目模式。数字代表通常识别出的影响范围。",
    "Request a Diagnostic for Your Team": "为您的团队预约诊断",
    "What industries do you specialize in?": "你们专注于哪些行业？",
    "We work across B2B industries including SaaS, professional services, logistics, manufacturing, and multi-location operators. The diagnostic is industry-agnostic: it focuses on process, data flow, and system architecture rather than a specific vertical.": "我们服务于多种 B2B 行业，包括 SaaS、专业服务、物流、制造和多门店运营商。诊断不限行业：它聚焦于流程、数据流和系统架构，而非特定垂直领域。",
    "Can you help migrate from Salesforce to HubSpot?": "你们能帮忙从 Salesforce 迁移到 HubSpot 吗？",
    "Yes. CRM migration is a common outcome of the RevOps diagnostic. We map your current data model, pipeline logic, and integrations before recommending a migration path. We work with both Salesforce and HubSpot environments.": "可以。CRM 迁移是 RevOps 诊断的常见结果。我们会先梳理您当前的数据模型、管道逻辑和集成，再推荐迁移路径。我们同时支持 Salesforce 和 HubSpot 环境。",
    "How is a diagnostic different from a consulting engagement?": "诊断与咨询项目有何不同？",
    "The diagnostic is a structured, time-boxed review that identifies what is broken and why. A consulting engagement implements the fix. We separate the two so you never pay for implementation before the problem is validated.": "诊断是一次有结构、有时限的审查，找出哪里出了问题以及原因。咨询项目则负责实施修复。我们将两者分开，让您在问题得到验证之前不必为实施付费。",
    "What does a typical RevOps audit include?": "典型的 RevOps 审计包括什么？",
    "A RevOps audit covers CRM structure, pipeline stages, reporting definitions, data sources, key integrations, and automation rules. The output is a prioritized fix list with estimated effort and impact for each item.": "RevOps 审计涵盖 CRM 结构、管道阶段、报告定义、数据源、关键集成和自动化规则。输出是一份按优先级排列的修复清单，包含每项的预估工作量和影响。",

    "Every engagement starts with a free diagnostic. You only pay once scope is agreed in writing.": "每一次合作都从免费诊断开始。只有在范围以书面形式确认后，您才需付费。",
