    "Diagnostic-first IT and business development for B2B companies dealing with process, CRM, data flow, and automation problems.": "以诊断为先的 IT 与业务开发，服务于面临流程、CRM、数据流和自动化问题的 B2B 企业。",
    "Serial entrepreneur with 10+ companies founded across the US and Europe. EB-1A green card holder, recognized for extraordinary ability in business and technology. Leads diagnostic methodology and operating model design at Fill System.": "连续创业者，在美国和欧洲创立过10余家公司。EB-1A 绿卡持有者，因在商业和技术领域的杰出能力获得认可。在 Fill System 负责诊断方法论与运营模式设计。",
    "International IT professionals community providing certified talent, mentorship, and industry expertise for project teams and consulting work.": "国际IT专业人士社区，为项目团队和咨询工作提供认证人才、导师指导和行业专长。",
    "Before Fill System, Igor founded business incubators, startup accelerators, and prototyping centers, mentoring 150+ entrepreneurs and contributing to entrepreneurship legislation. He has built enterprise software, led cloud migrations, and run cross-border tech projects.": "在 Fill System 之前，Igor 创办了企业孵化器、创业加速器和原型中心，指导过150余位创业者，并参与了创业立法工作。他曾开发企业级软件、主导云迁移，并管理跨境技术项目。",
